  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 101 * 32 * 4 * 5 * 7 * 128 \n\nOption 1) –, ×, +, ÷, =\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 101 - 32 × 4 + __**5 ÷ 7**__ = 128\n\n⇒ 101 - __**32 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 0.71 = 128\n\n⇒ __**101**__ - 128 __**+**____** 0.71**__ = 128\n\n⇒ __**101.71 - 128**__ = 128\n\n⇒ -26.29 = 128\n\n**Option 2) –, ÷, +, ×, = **\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 101 - __**32 ÷ 4**__ + 5 × 7 = 128 \n\n⇒ 101 - 8 + __**5 **____**×**____** 7**__ = 128 \n\n⇒ __**101 **__- 8 __**+ 35**__ = 128 \n\n⇒ __**136 - 8**__ = 128 \n\n**⇒ 128 = 128**\n\nOption 3) ÷, +, ×, –, = \n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ __**101 ÷ 32**__ + 4 × 5 - 7 = 128 \n\n⇒ 3.15 + __**4 **____**× **____**5**__ - 7 = 128 \n\n⇒ __**3.15 **____**+ 20**__ - 7 = 128\n\n⇒ __**23.15**____** - 7**__ = 128 \n\n⇒ 16.15 = 128 \n\nOption 4) +, ×, –, ÷, =\n\nBy replacing the * signs:\n\n⇒ 101 + 32 × 4 - __**5 ÷ 7**__ = 128\n\n⇒ 101 + **__32 __****__× __****__4__** - 0.71 = 128\n\n⇒ __**101 + 128**__ - 0.71 = 128\n\n⇒__** 229**____** - 0.71**__ = 128\n\n⇒ 228.29 = 128\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"–, ÷, +, ×, =\".**",
